{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55291","headline":"岳阳楼诗（题拟） 三 · 范质","name":"岳阳楼诗（题拟） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可笑祖龙游不得，欲於何处访蓬莱。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷六九《岳州》。\n）（按：范质入宋後，均在汴京。\n诗爲其早年作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范质","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}